      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要在規定的空間裡面，\n持續躲開野生寶可夢的攻擊就行！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
